      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but it feels like those \"criticisms\" were mostly just excuses used by big corporations to avoid paying fair wages and keep people down. wouldn't you say the movement's success in redistributing power was a more direct and important historical fact than some abstract economic debate about inflation or growth?",
